# Yarus, Roar of the Old Gods: "Other creatures you control have haste" and "Whenever one or more face-down creatures you
# control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card" (CR 510.2, 708.2; the ruling: once for each player dealt damage, however
# many creatures dealt it). Turn 1 Bot1 casts Yarus, then Vengeful Creeper face down for its disguise; the hasted face-down 2/2
# attacks at once and Bot1 draws Basilica Stalker. Turn 3 Bot1 casts the Stalker face down too and attacks with both: four
# damage to Bot2, one card drawn. Yarus itself, face up and not attacking, has no haste of its own.

